   "ocr_text": "mOmCOZy\nBreast Pumps\nu-o MontAs\nBras\neveryday & reeaing\nBody Pillows\nPregnancy\nFeeding Gear\n0-36 Months\nInfant Towels and\nOther essential Bath\nItems for Babies\nLearn About Bath Items for Babies\nBathing your child is a wonderful opportunity for\nthem to relax. The most practical way to bathe your\nbaby is to use special baby bath essentials. When\nyour child is older, there are different systems to\ninstall it in the large bathtub: deckchair or bath chair\nand bath ring. Let's find out together the essential\nbath items for babies.\nBath Essentials for Cozy Bath Time\nTowel\nFor babies, there are many cute\nmodels, some with a small hood. This\nwill keep your head warm and dry it\nwell. You can also opt for a bathrobe so\nthat your child stays warm while you\nwait for you to dress them.\nThermometer\nIt is an inexpensive purchase, but\none that can prevent many\naccidents. Indeed, the water must\nhave a precise temperature, which\nmust be between 35 and 37\ndegrees Celsius.\nBathing Chair\nWith its headrest and suction cups\nthat hold the deckchair even with\nbaby's many movements, you will\nhave your hands free to wash your\nchild and enjoy these moments of\nhappiness spent with your baby.\nBathtub\nIt adapts to your baby's size to facilitate\nwashing. Be careful, even if it is the\nright size for your infant; remember\nalways to hold his head so that he does\nnot go underwater!\nChoosing the right product can keep your baby\nmore safe. All you need to choose the right essentials\nthat make the moment of complicity to the moment\nof relaxation and well-being.\nFor information on how to bath a baby, head over to\nhere: Bathe A Baby\nGet Your Guide →\n*Disclaimer: For informational purposes only. Please\nconsult a healthcare professional for medical advice.\nmomcozy\nf\n1580 N Logan St Ste 660, #30327, Denver,\nCO 80203-1994, USA\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms & Conditions\nAll Rights Reserved © 2026 Momcozy.\nWarranty Policy",
